  "source_brief": {
    "silhouette": "A tall broad chest, short swept-back horns and an upright oval shield. A compact crest rises behind the forehead without adding wings or a tail.",
    "face": "Pearl-gold scales, deep amber eyes and a short rounded muzzle. Keep the mouth closed at rest and use a calm expression, not a permanent display of teeth.",
    "costume": "White-and-blue ceremonial armor with broad articulated panels, a short tabard and armored boots built around plantigrade feet.",
    "palette": "Pearl #E0D8C1; royal blue #486A9A; gold #C4A367; dark slate #4D5B67.",
    "equipment": "An oval fantasy shield with a single beacon gem and a short ceremonial mace. The gem is cosmetic outside the shield cast.",
    "signature": "Swept horns, oval beacon shield and pale armored torso.",
    "materials": "Matte scale normals at low frequency, brushed armor and one gem emissive mask. Do not model every scale.",
    "back": "A short raised neck crest ends above the shoulders. No wings, tail or dangling cloth; clear shoulders make retargeting manageable.",
    "animation": "Idle stands tall with the shield close. Walk uses slow deliberate steps. Basics strike compactly. The active angles the shield upward and lights the beacon disk before a protective shell forms.",
    "vfx": "A pale-gold shield outline with a small vertical glint, never a full-screen column of light.",
    "audio": "Low resonant chime and a measured armor movement; no roaring requirement.",
    "risk": "Muzzle, neck crest and shoulder plates need a draconic rig review. Do not force a human head mesh under a scale texture."
  },
  "equipment": "Visual only; oval beacon shield and short ceremonial mace, fixed decorative gem",
